@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@supplierOrderId = 1
@customerOrderId = 1

### Supplier order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderhistory/supplierorders/{{supplierOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderhistory/customerorders/{{customerOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown order returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderhistory/supplierorders/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
